
Echo On
// Addition
Set a To 5
Add 1 To a
Assert a Is 6

Add a, a To b
Assert a Is 6 And b Is 12

Add 1, 2 To 3 Giving c
Assert c Is 6

// Set Up
Set counter To Zero
Set counter Up By 5
Assert counter Is 5
Set counter Up By (2 * 3) + 1
Assert counter Is 12

// Subtraction
Set a To 5
Subtract 3 From a
Assert a Is 2
Subtract a, a From a
Assert a Is -2
Subtract 5 From a Giving b
Assert a Is -2 And b is -7

// Set Down
Set counter To 5
Set counter Down By 2
Assert counter Is 3
Set counter Down By (counter * 2)
Assert counter is -3

// Multiplication
Set a To 2
Multiply a By 5
Assert a Is 10

Set b To 3
Multiply b By 3, 2
Assert b Is 18

// Division
Set a To 5
Divide a By 2
Assert a Is 2.5

Set b To 5
Divide a By b, .5
Assert a Is 1
